OL,3,GNEWSACliff work proposed after 2024
OL,4,Alandslips
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork has been outlined that would
OL,7,Fenable the base of a cliff to reopen to
OL,8,Fthe public after landslips two years
OL,9,Fago.
OL,11,FAbout 14 beach huts were pushed forward
OL,12,Facross the promenade to the beach's
OL,13,Fedge at West Cliff in Bournemouth
OL,14,Ffollowing slips on 9 and 19 October
OL,15,F2024.
OL,17,FSoil nails ` long steel reinforcing
OL,18,Fbars ` would be pinned into the cliff
OL,19,Fin an effort to give it "long-term
OL,20,Fstability", Bournemouth, Christchurch
OL,21,Fand Poole (BCP) Council said.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
